# Wiflow firmware for Viettel NR3053 - lean build seed (make defconfig resolves the rest).
# Base: quytttb/immortalwrt-mt798x-rebase v2.3.6 (495af17), defconfig/viettel-only.config:
#  - same target, kernel and MediaTek WiFi driver options (unchanged lines below),
#  - only the NR3053 (single profile),
#  - kernel modules the firmware does not ship stay "m" (built, not in the image) so
#    the kernel is configured exactly as in v2.3.6,
#  - userspace extras removed; Wiflow added.

